BO_ 1814 DME8_Version: 8 DME
 SG_ DME_SW_Byte0 : 0|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" DME
 SG_ DME_SW_Byte1 : 8|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" DME
