 SG_ DME_SW_Byte6 : 48|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" DME
 SG_ DME_SW_Byte7 : 56|8@1+ (1,0) [0|255] "" DME

CM_ BO_ 1814 "Motronic software version. ASCII '5e' in bytes 0-1.";


; ─── 0x718 (1816) — PSM5 [?] ────────────────────────────────────
