CM_ BO_ 1817 "Gateway wake/sleep state. D4 changes 0x0B→0x5B at startup transition.";


; ─── 0x71A (1818) — SCCM3 [?] ────────────────────────────────────
BO_ 1818 SCCM3: 8 SCCM
